{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c Let\u2019s go\u2014the sky is calling.\u201d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seraphine's Skyward Journey is an adventure game where you explore a steampunk-inspired world rendered in 2.5D hand-drawn graphics, flying an airship on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, countless floating continents and bases exist in the sky. Traveling between them, you undertake various missions\u2014transporting goods, trading, and sometimes even defeating sky pirates\u2014all while journeying toward the Deep Sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To operate your airship, you must manage coal for the steam engine, replenish other resources, and perform ship maintenance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, driven by the unknown awaiting beyond, you press forward.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008030?t=1770647630","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008030?t=1770647630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008030/74bf2f3f2b20928e976cbc6861159026edee58f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770647630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008030/74bf2f3f2b20928e976cbc6861159026edee58f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770647630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c Let\u2019s go\u2014the sky is calling.\u201d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seraphine's Skyward Journey is an adventure game where you explore a steampunk-inspired world rendered in 2.5D hand-drawn graphics, flying an airship on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, countless floating continents and bases exist in the sky. Traveling between them, you